Verdict: NOT_SUPPORTED
Rationale: The claim states that the sub-units using two types of RNA are major components of the ribosomal unit. However, the evidence shows that ribosomal subunits consist of ribosomal RNA (rRNA) and ribosomal proteins, not two types of RNA. The evidence does not mention any sub-units using two types of RNA, contradicting the claim's material part about the RNA types.
Rounds: 3, findings: 6
